WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.100
SCP-035 VS SCP-055.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.720
The diabolically evil Possessive Mask Vs the
immensely frustrating Anti-Meme.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.840
Who would win, and would we even remember
the result?

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:17.029
SCP-035 is an evil ancient Greek theatrical
mask with a demonic tendency to take over

00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:21.800
people’s bodies, kill them, and slowly melt
them down with corrosive black slime.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.630
SCP-055 isn’t a sphere.

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:26.340
That’s all we really know.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.410
So we’re not entirely sure whether 035 would
even fit onto it.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.410
And uh…Uhhhh…

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.850
I’m sorry, what was this short about again?

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.030
Why am I here today?

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.030
Any one?

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:36.031
Hehhhh?

